 "description": "Create a product, or change one. Found by id when given, otherwise by name (ignoring case) and created when there is none, so saving the same product twice changes nothing the second time.\n\naccount_ids is the complete list of accounts that post for it: accounts in another product move here, and accounts in this one that are not listed leave it. Leave it out to keep the accounts as they are. A product holds accounts from one workspace; when you are in several and name no accounts, pass workspace_id (from accounts_list).",
